.574">one </span><span begin="00:41.574" end="00:41.863">that </span><span begin="00:41.863" end="00:42.374">matters</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.374" end="00:42.720"><span begin="00:42.374" end="00:42.720">Luke：</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.720" end="00:46.979"><span begin="00:42.720" end="00:42.880">I </span><span begin="00:42.880" end="00:43.040">don't </span><span begin="00:43.040" end="00:43.265">wanna </span><span begin="00:43.265" end="00:43.890">kill </span><span begin="00:43.890" end="00:44.592">my </span><span begin="00:44.592" end="00:45.308">time </span><span begin="00:45.308" end="00:45.764">with </span><span begin="00:45.764" end="00:46.051">somebody </span><span begin="00:46.051" end="00:46.979">else</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.532" end="00:50.882"><span begin="00:48.532" end="00:48.834">Dancing </span><span begin="00:48.834" end="00:49.010">in </span><span begin="00:49.010" end="00:49.202">the </span><span begin="00:49.202" end="00:49.572">dark </span><span begin="00:49.572" end="00:49.747">'til </span><span begin="00:49.747" end="00:49.922">the </span><span begin="00:49.922" end="00:50.244">sun </span><span begin="00:50.244" end="00:50.882">comes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.117" end="00:53.339"><span begin="00:51.117" end="00:51.534">Tangled </span><span begin="00:51.534" end="00:51.741">in </span><span begin="00:51.741" end="00:51.917">the </span><span begin="00:51.917" end="00:52.237">sheets </span><span begin="00:52.237" end="00:52.415">'til </span><span begin="00:52.415" end="00:52.589">the </span><span begin="00:52.589" end="00:52.941">day's </span><span begin="00:52.941" end="00:53.339">done</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.339" end="00:57.664"><span begin="00:53.339" end="00:53.483">I </span><span begin="00:53.483" end="00:53.646">don't </span><span begin="00:53.646" end="00:53.931">wanna </span><span begin="00:53.931" end="00:54.672">kill </span><span begin="00:54.672" end="00:55.297"